=== exp1: CE traffic vs independent sm90 GEMM ===
world 4, GEMM on GPU 0, fp16 CUTLASS (TmaWarpSpecializedCooperative 128x256x64)
GPU 0: NVIDIA H20  sm_90  78 SMs  1980 MHz
GPU 1: NVIDIA H20  sm_90  78 SMs  1980 MHz
GPU 2: NVIDIA H20  sm_90  78 SMs  1980 MHz
GPU 3: NVIDIA H20  sm_90  78 SMs  1980 MHz
[note] lock clocks (nvidia-smi -lgc) before trusting slowdowns.

--- GEMM 2048x2048x2048 fp16: alone 156.5 us/iter (p95 156.9), 109.8 TFLOP/s, 1272 iters ---
pattern     msg    | ovl us/iter   ovl p95    S_c  TFLOP/s | alone GB/s   ovl GB/s | note
pull        64M    |       158.7     159.9  1.014    108.2 |     393.75     392.76 | 
push        64M    |       157.3     158.4  1.005    109.2 |     396.08     386.38 | 
allgather   64M    |       170.0     181.2  1.087    101.0 |     728.31     897.05 | 
bystander   64M    |       156.4     156.9  1.000    109.8 |     478.47    1075.96 | 
engine-only 64M    |       156.6     157.1  1.001    109.7 |     373.21     361.29 | 
local       64M    |       159.4     160.6  1.019    107.8 |    1514.68     413.60 | 
baseline recheck: alone 156.5 -> 156.0 us/iter (drift -0.3%)

