--- GEMM 8192x8192x8192 fp16: alone 7886.1 us/iter (p95 7889.8), 139.4 TFLOP/s, 25 iters ---
pattern     msg    | ovl us/iter   ovl p95    S_c  TFLOP/s | alone GB/s   ovl GB/s | note
pull        64M    |      7886.8    7890.6  1.000    139.4 |     393.84     391.96 | 
push        64M    |      7886.1    7889.6  1.000    139.4 |     396.08     387.44 | 
allgather   64M    |      7897.8    7909.2  1.001    139.2 |     728.35     930.26 | 
bystander   64M    |      7886.6    7890.3  1.000    139.4 |     478.30    1083.88 | 
engine-only 64M    |      7886.6    7891.2  1.000    139.4 |     372.60     365.59 | 
